      "verified": true,
      "fine_trace_step": 1,
      "description": "Source. The config reader copies attacker-controlled file bytes into the expandable `line` buffer. Because the staged witness has no CR or LF, repeated loop iterations accumulate the entire 4118-byte file into one config line that is later tokenized into `includefile` plus a 4106-byte operand."
    },
    {
      "invariant_id": "r_includefile_operand_must_fit_snmp_maxpath",
